        <mxCell id="90" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;rounded=1;shadow=0;" value="&lt;br&gt;1) Start at &lt;b&gt;run.py&lt;/b&gt; (entrypoint).&lt;br&gt;2) It &lt;b&gt;creates&lt;/b&gt; &lt;b&gt;PuraloxApp&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;br&gt;3) &lt;b&gt;PuraloxApp&lt;/b&gt; &lt;b&gt;owns&lt;/b&gt; its main components (black diamond).&lt;br&gt;4) Components talk to the &lt;b&gt;IDatabase&lt;/b&gt; interface; &lt;b&gt;DatabaseManager&lt;/b&gt; implements it.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Arrow legend&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Black diamond&lt;/b&gt; = composition / ownership (lifecycle owned).&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Dashed «create»&lt;/b&gt; = instantiation (new object created).&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Solid line&lt;/b&gt; = association (has a reference).&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Dashed hollow triangle&lt;/b&gt; = realization (implements interface)." vertex="1">
